{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11103090","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11103090","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1110309001:1":{"text":"呼——","source_cn":"呼——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB797FA5279E25B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110309002:1":{"text":"你还要深呼吸到什么时候？难道要让布鲁特斯大人等着你吗？","source_cn":"你还要深呼吸到什么时候？难道要让布鲁特斯大人等着你吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B1B79FEB765F033","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110309003:1":{"text":"我才不会！布鲁特斯大人，您最后一击……相当精彩。","source_cn":"我才不会！布鲁特斯大人，您最后一击……相当精彩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3243B35880331F5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110309004:1":{"text":"年轻人，你的武艺在这个年纪也相当不俗。乌尔氏族的——","source_cn":"年轻人，你的武艺在这个年纪也相当不俗。乌尔氏族的——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFC3C9BA30CBB3CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110309005:1":{"text":"索恩！布鲁特斯大人，他叫索恩！我……我叫阿尔萨！","source_cn":"索恩！布鲁特斯大人，他叫索恩！我……我叫阿尔萨！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC15FA2E91B5C73DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110309006:1":{"text":"阿尔萨和索恩？很好，终于把你们的名字跟脸对上了。","source_cn":"阿尔萨和索恩？很好，终于把你们的名字跟脸对上了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19C0F15429BD00CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110309007:1":{"text":"您，您知道我们？","source_cn":"您，您知道我们？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E3089A120D9AC86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110309008:1":{"text":"曼卡拉可是隆重地跟我介绍了你们——多年未曾有过，初次参赛便通过试炼的新生代！","source_cn":"曼卡拉可是隆重地跟我介绍了你们——多年未曾有过，初次参...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC22E0DEB42F2909","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110309009:1":{"text":"啊啊啊啊！布鲁特斯大人知道我们的名字——嗷！你掐我干嘛！难道还以为是做梦？","source_cn":"啊啊啊啊！布鲁特斯大人知道我们的名字——嗷！你掐我干嘛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07B2D1A8A05C615E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110309010:1":{"text":"……抱歉，只是……这一切，太不像真的了。","source_cn":"……抱歉，只是……这一切，太不像真的了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94E5775555E5AEF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1110309010":{"text":"……抱歉，只是……这一切，太不像真的了。","source_cn":"……抱歉，只是……这一切，太不像真的了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94E5775555E5AEF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110309011:2":{"text":"索恩，阿尔萨，刚才那场战斗，你们以寡敌众，还要保护弱小——","source_cn":"索恩，阿尔萨，刚才那场战斗，你们以寡敌众，还要保护弱小——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18B51DA0EB8096E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110309012:1":{"text":"这并不是一场公平的战斗，但你们面对强敌时，从未退缩。","source_cn":"这并不是一场公平的战斗，但你们面对强敌时，从未退缩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x728FDEB0A3A03B4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110309013:1":{"text":"那么，在“魂之试炼”中，你们能保持这份坚强吗？","source_cn":"那么，在“魂之试炼”中，你们能保持这份坚强吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAFD712A17EEE859","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110309014:1":{"text":"嗯。无论敌人何等可怕，我们都绝不会临阵脱逃。","source_cn":"嗯。无论敌人何等可怕，我们都绝不会临阵脱逃。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24E0061EBBDD939B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110309015:1":{"text":"哦？可怕的敌人吗？","source_cn":"哦？可怕的敌人吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C50C6AD61EBAD58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index"